WEBVTT

00:10:59.988 --> 00:11:01.824
they assumed they were palaces.

00:11:01.824 --> 00:11:05.077
Then they realized that just
about everyone in the city

00:11:05.119 --> 00:11:08.372
was living in a palace
with spacious patios

00:11:08.372 --> 00:11:10.040
and subfloor drainages,

00:11:10.082 --> 00:11:12.584
gorgeous murals on the walls.

00:11:13.127 --> 00:11:15.087
But we shouldn't get carried away.

00:11:15.879 --> 00:11:18.882
None of the societies
that I've been describing

00:11:18.924 --> 00:11:21.927
was perfectly egalitarian.

00:11:23.137 --> 00:11:26.890
But then we might also remember
that fifth-century Athens,

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:30.269
which we look to
as the birthplace of democracy,